<title>USA: Shell's Manta Ray to start system expansion.</title>
<headline>Shell's Manta Ray to start system expansion.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Oil Co said Wednesday the Manta Ray Offshore Gathering Co LLC plans to proceed with a $60 million expansion of its natural gas gathering system in the central Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>Shell, U.S. subsidiary of Royal Dutch/Shell Group, holds a 50 percent interest in Manta Ray through affiliates. Leviathan Gas Pipeline Partners LP has 25.67 percent with the remaining 24.33 percent held by Marathon Oil Co.</p>
<p>Regulatory review of the expansion project was completed February 27, Shell said.</p>
</text>
